Z||000000||chris6878||03-26-2000||01:06 AM||||Does anyone make a rear window louver for the fiero?  I think thats the name of it anyway...   it would match the decklid vents. ...   i have seen these on everthing else, mustangs, VW's, S-10's and so on.. wondering if they made one for the fiero...  my local parts shop says there suppliers dont offer one..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>thanks for any replies...||||reg||5
